{"matched":11,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T14n0450_p0405a01","n":"0405a","t":"佛告曼殊室利東方去此過十"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T14n0450_p0405b01","n":"0405b","t":"眾病逼切無救無歸無醫無藥"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T14n0450_p0405c01","n":"0405c","t":"菩薩道時所發大願及彼佛土"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T14n0450_p0406a01","n":"0406a","t":"由增上慢覆蔽心故自是非他"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T14n0450_p0406b01","n":"0406b","t":"彼命及壞其身是諸有情若得"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T14n0450_p0406c01","n":"0406c","t":"而用安處爾時四大天王與其"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T14n0450_p0407a01","n":"0407a","t":"供養彼世尊藥師琉璃光如來"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T14n0450_p0407b01","n":"0407b","t":"處阿難此是諸佛甚深所行難"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T14n0450_p0407c01","n":"0407c","t":"爾時阿難問救脫菩薩曰善男"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T14n0450_p0408a01","n":"0408a","t":"不聞如來說有九橫死耶是故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T14n0450_p0408b01","n":"0408b","t":"招杜羅大將毘羯羅大將此十"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T14n0450-藥師琉璃光如來本願功德經","source":"CBETA T14n0450 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":11,"unit":"T14 頁欄"}